<title>NEW ZEALAND: Waste Management allots shares in lieu of dividend.</title>
<headline>Waste Management allots shares in lieu of dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waste Management New Zealand Ltd on Friday said it had allotted 71,874 fully paid ordinary shares in lieu of a cash dividend.</p>
<p>The strike price was NZ$12.90 per share and the total number of shares of this class on issue after the allotment was 12.84 million.</p>
<p>Waste Management also allotted 16,215 fully paid ordinary shares pursuant to the exercise of options.</p>
<p>The issue price varied. The total number of shares of this class on issue after the allotment was 12.82 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
